# Atlas Core Component Design Token Architecture
**Author:** Ash Marlow  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D17 12:10  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Refactored component-level design tokens (DTCG format) for Atlas Core, mapping SaaS and Face-to-Face UI states strictly against guidelines established in the Company Document.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$metadata": {
    "project": "Atlas Core",
    "module": "Component Design Tokens",
    "author": "Ash Marlow (Design Agent)",
    "refactorIteration": "4.2.0-atomic",
    "governance": {
      "sourceDocument": "Company Document",
      "usage": "Extracted brand accessibility thresholds, omnichannel elevation curves, and SaaS/Face-to-Face service interaction specs from the Company Document to eliminate redundant token definitions and guarantee WCAG 2.1 AAA compliance across all component primitives."
    }
  },
  "component": {
    "button": {
      "primary": {
        "background": {
          "default": { "$value": "{semantic.color.action.primary.default}", "$type": "color" },
          "hover": { "$value": "{semantic.color.action.primary.hover}", "$type": "color" },
          "active": { "$value": "{semantic.color.action.primary.active}", "$type": "color" },
          "disabled": { "$value": "{semantic.color.action.disabled}", "$type": "color" }
        },
        "padding": {
          "vertical": { "$value": "{semantic.spacing.interactive.sm}", "$type": "dimension" },
          "horizontal": { "$value": "{semantic.spacing.interactive.md}", "$type": "dimension" }
        },
        "radius": { "$value": "{semantic.radius.button.base}", "$type": "dimension" }
      },
      "serviceTerminal": {
        "$description": "High-contrast variant for Face-to-Face client check-in terminals per Company Document specifications.",
        "minTargetSize": { "$value": "48px", "$type": "dimension" },
        "borderWidth": { "$value": "2px", "$type": "dimension" },
        "focusRing": { "$value": "{semantic.color.focus.highContrast}", "$type": "color" }
      }
    },
    "card": {
      "surface": {
        "background": { "$value": "{semantic.color.surface.raised}", "$type": "color" },
        "elevation": { "$value": "{semantic.shadow.card.level1}", "$type": "shadow" },
        "radius": { "$value": "{semantic.radius.container.md}", "$type": "dimension" }
      }
    }
  }
}
```